    "V3: Removed isolation barrier (CA-IS3742HW + B0505S + buffer + target LDO + power switch) for simplicity and cost reduction.",
    "Protection: 22R series resistors on SWDIO/SWCLK/SWO for current limiting in fault conditions.",
    "200mA PTC fuse on 5V target output prevents short-circuit damage to host.",
    "SRV05-4 provides 4-channel ESD/TVS protection on target-facing signals.",
    "nRESET open-drain NMOS (2N7002) retained for bidirectional level-safe reset.",
    "VTREF ADC divider remains for target voltage monitoring.",
    "Target connector uses a 2x4 2.54mm header carrying VCC, SWDIO, SWCLK, GND, nRESET/SWO, and UART TX/RX; pin 6 is tied to GND.",
    "RP2040 BOOTSEL/QSPI_SS is local to RP2040, flash, button, and pull network; ESP32 does not directly drive the QSPI chip-select net.",
